[0.000, "o", "36muser\u001b[0m\r\nUse $sams-gen-writing to review this AI-assisted page against Google's guidance and tell me what it needs before publishing.\r\n\r\n<stdin>\r\n<!-- Synthetic demo input: an AI-drafted page invented for a skill demo. -->\r\n# The 10 Best Hiking Boots of 2026: Ultimate Buyer's Guide\r\n\r\nMeta description: Discover the best hiking boots of 2026! Our experts tested hundreds of boots to find\r\nthe perfect pair for every adventurer.\r\n\r\nHiking boots are an essential piece of gear for any outdoor enthusiast. In today's fast-paced world,\r\nchoosing the right boots can be overwhelming. That's why our team of experts has done the hard work\r\nfor you.\r\n\r\n## 1. TrailMaster Pro X\r\nThe TrailMaster Pro X is a game-changer. It offers unparalleled comfort, durability, and support.\r\nRating: 9.8/10.\r\n\r\n## 2. Summit Elite 3\r\nWith its cutting-edge design, the Summit Elite 3 delivers exceptional performance on any terrain.\r\nRating: 9.6/10.\r\n\r\n## Frequently asked questions\r\n**How long do hiking boots last?** Most hiking boots last b"]
[0.000, "o", "etween 500 and 1,000 miles.\r\n\r\nIn conclusion, the right hiking boots can make or break your adventure. Happy hiking!\r\n\r\nAuthor: Staff Writer. Last updated: today.\r\n</stdin>\r\n"]
[5.627, "o", "\u001b[35m\u001b[3mcodex\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\nI’m using the sams-gen-writing skill to review the page’s evidence, reader value, and publication gaps. I’ll check Google’s current guidance and distinguish policy requirements from editorial recommendations.\r\n"]
